# WOLFGATE - NPC traders added to Caelestinus Central (Docs/Wolfgate/Traders/plan.md)

## Otho Kessler - EVA outfitter (astro_trader.yml)
trader-astro-greeting = Suit up or ship out?
trader-astro-farewell = Mind the airlock cycle.
trader-astro-prompt-shop = What have you got for sale?
trader-astro-response-shop = Suits, mag-boots, jetpacks - if it keeps you alive out there, I've got it.
trader-astro-prompt-who = Who are you?
trader-astro-response-who = Name's Otho Kessler. I've fitted crews for vacuum work longer than most of you have been breathing station air. EVA suits, hardsuits, pilot's kit - buy it before you undock, the hull doesn't care how sorry you are.

## Reeva Okafor - salvage equipment dealer (salvage_trader.yml)
trader-salvage-greeting = Come to gear up for the field?
trader-salvage-farewell = Watch your footing out there.
trader-salvage-prompt-shop = What have you got for sale?
trader-salvage-response-shop = Everything a salvager needs to crack rock and come home with something to show for it.
trader-salvage-prompt-who = What do you do?
trader-salvage-response-who = Reeva Okafor. Ran expeditions out past the belt for a decade before my knees said no more debris fields. Now I keep the salvage crews stocked - crushers, kinetic accelerators, drills, the works.

## Marcus Delgado - flatpack wholesaler (flatpack_trader.yml)
trader-flatpack-greeting = Looking to fold out a new machine?
trader-flatpack-farewell = Mind the crate corners on your way out.
trader-flatpack-prompt-shop = What have you got for sale?
trader-flatpack-response-shop = Fabricators, airlocks, an FTL drive if you've got the hull for it - name the machine, I'll box it up.
trader-flatpack-prompt-who = Who are you?
trader-flatpack-response-who = Marcus Delgado, flatpack broker. I never touch a wrench myself - I just make sure every machine worth having ships flat and folds out on your deck plate. Cheaper than a shipyard refit, if you ask me.

## Pip Yoon - hardware store clerk (tools_trader.yml)
trader-tools-greeting = Need a hand with something?
trader-tools-farewell = Bring it back if it breaks - within reason.
trader-tools-prompt-shop = What have you got for sale?
trader-tools-response-shop = Hand tools, cable, RCDs, ship repair kits - if it fixes something, it's on my shelf.
trader-tools-prompt-who = What do you do?
trader-tools-response-who = Pip Yoon, I run the hardware counter. Half the station's held together with what I sell - screwdrivers to RCDs to the odd nanite applicator. Ask if you don't see it, I probably have it in the back.

## Wilhelmina Farrow - clothier (clothes_trader.yml)
trader-clothes-greeting = Looking sharp or looking warm?
trader-clothes-farewell = Wear it well.
trader-clothes-prompt-shop = What have you got for sale?
trader-clothes-response-shop = Backpacks, jumpsuits, shoes - plain, sturdy, and it'll actually fit you.
trader-clothes-prompt-who = Who are you?
trader-clothes-response-who = Wilhelmina Farrow. I've dressed half of Caelestinus Central out of the back of this stall - nothing fancy, just clean uniforms and good boots that won't fall apart on shift one.

## John Wolfgate
trader-wolfgate-greeting = John Wolfgate. Good to see you.
trader-wolfgate-farewell = Tell them Wolfgate sent you.
trader-wolfgate-prompt-shop = What have you got for sale?
trader-wolfgate-response-shop = Only the good stuff. Have a look.
trader-wolfgate-prompt-who = Who are you?
trader-wolfgate-response-who = John Wolfgate. My name's on the gate, the station and half the crates in the hold. Anything built under that name ends up on my shelves before it ends up anywhere else.
